## where-to-vibe system prompt patch
##
## STATUS: ALREADY APPLIED in macos-app/where-to-vibe/CompanionManager.swift
## inside this repo. This file is kept as a reference describing the exact
## three edits, so the same change can be reproduced on a fresh upstream
